        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Chronic hand and forearm rash symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Rash for more than 20 years, worse over the last 3–4 months, with burning, itching, cracks, and occasional minor weeping. Flares with dishwashing, lemon dish liquid, and strong soaps. Scratches at night and sometimes soaks hands in hot water."
      }
    },
    {
